WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:03,760
Uncle Tie, how is that gray star yarn doing now?

2
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:06,300
Don't worry if you leave the things here with me.

3
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:07,900
Uncle Tie kept it for you to raise

4
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:09,100
Better than being in the sea

5
00:00:09,540 --> 00:00:10,980
I have also contacted several buyers

6
00:00:11,260 --> 00:00:12,500
Two of them are already interested in their hometown.

7
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,120
Could you please, Uncle Tie, give me more snacks?

8
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:19,800
It's a small thing It's a small thing

9
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:21,840
I also get a commission from the sale of Gray Star Yarn

10
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:23,040
It's a win-win situation for us

11
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:24,480
Of course I will try my best

12
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:26,080
Okay, then I'll leave first

13
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:38,370
Uncle, you are back, you are back

14
00:00:38,810 --> 00:00:41,570
Song and Yuan went to sea for the first time today. They worked hard for these twenty years.

15
00:00:41,810 --> 00:00:43,410
Includes your base salary and bonus

16
00:00:43,890 --> 00:00:46,790
Uncle, this is too much

17
00:00:47,190 --> 00:00:48,390
I've only been working for one day

18
00:00:48,990 --> 00:00:50,990
Salary is salary and bonus is bonus

19
00:00:53,090 --> 00:00:54,770
Then, how about uncle?

20
00:00:54,770 --> 00:00:56,570
Give the money to my mother. I'm still young.

21
00:00:57,330 --> 00:00:58,930
This is your uncle's reward for your work.

22
00:00:59,330 --> 00:01:01,290
Do you want to give it to your mom, give it to your dad, or keep it for yourself?

23
00:01:01,290 --> 00:01:05,310
It's your business. I don't care.

24
00:01:06,570 --> 00:01:08,290
Mom, let me save the money first

25
00:01:08,610 --> 00:01:11,780
Wait until it's time for dad to change the dressing and then take it out and use it.

26
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:26,000
Jianguo, why are you still breaking out of the fishing net here?

27
00:01:26,240 --> 00:01:28,040
You have a distinguished guest coming to your house. You should go back quickly.

28
00:01:29,300 --> 00:01:30,860
Distinguished guest, what distinguished guest?

29
00:01:31,300 --> 00:01:32,540
just over an hour ago

30
00:01:32,540 --> 00:01:33,700
There are two in uniform

31
00:01:33,700 --> 00:01:35,820
A man riding a military green bicycle went to your house

32
00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:37,380
The two men were wearing glasses

33
00:01:37,380 --> 00:01:38,580
I still have a pen in my pocket.

34
00:01:38,580 --> 00:01:39,740
At first glance, he looks like a cultural person

35
00:01:39,900 --> 00:01:40,820
After entering your home

36
00:01:40,820 --> 00:01:41,780
He never came out

37
00:01:41,940 --> 00:01:43,060
You should go back and take a look quickly.

38
00:01:43,300 --> 00:01:44,500
Could it be that I got a loan?
